      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "A different meeting place",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Sorrento",
            "accent": "it is."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "I usually suggest meeting in Amalfi, but Jatin had little time and could not make the journey. He was happy to wait for me in Sorrento, so we decided to photograph him at his hotel, away from the busy streets.",
            "What a place it turned out to be. Every corner offered something: mirrors, paintings, ceramics, beautiful chairs. We could have spent the whole session there without running out of backgrounds."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "spreads",
      "eyebrow": "02 / One very close call",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "The photograph.",
        "accent": "And the statue."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr2699",
        "cnr2791",
        "cnr2929",
