        "cnr2946",
        "cnr3032",
        "cnr3044",
        "cnr3105",
        "cnr3125",
        "cnr3318",
        "cnr3329",
        "cnr3375"
      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "One very close call",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "The photograph.",
            "accent": "And the statue."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "There is one moment from this shoot I will remember for a very long time. I carry an enormous backpack, and while concentrating on a photograph I caught a ceramic statue with it. The statue wobbled, began to fall, and somehow I caught it at the last second.",
            "I have no idea what it was worth. It looked expensive enough to make me very grateful for that catch. Sometimes I get so absorbed in the frame that I forget how much is going on around me."
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dissolve",
      "eyebrow": "03 / Finding his own rhythm",
      "heading": {
        "lead": "Less thinking.",
        "accent": "More Jatin."
      },
      "frameIds": [
        "cnr3387",
