      ],
      "before": [
        {
          "eyebrow": "Finding his own rhythm",
          "heading": {
            "lead": "Less thinking.",
            "accent": "More Jatin."
          },
          "paragraphs": [
            "This was Jatin’s first photoshoot. At first he kept noticing the camera and wondering how to pose. I have a posing guide for exactly this reason, but sometimes what helps most is simply a little pause and a change of mood.",
            "We took a short break for a drink, and afterwards something shifted. He laughed more, his expression softened, and he stopped following the camera. By the time we were out on the terraces, photographing him felt completely different.",
            "Finding that way in is one of my favourite parts of the job. You do not need experience in front of a camera. We just need to find what makes you comfortable enough to enjoy being there."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
